+wrapper, separately from task state, approved candidates, worker context, and
+display-only approval provenance. Preserve it through explicit evaluation
+recovery and saved-run continuation. Cover all six provider/model routes and
+both workers in the existing offline restart matrix. This corrects routing
+input; no live reliability improvement or provider precision fix is claimed.
